  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116150",
      "title": "Working with OnPush & Signals",
      "lectureOrder": 201,
      "videoOrder": 193,
      "sourceHash": "adb47ac3dfae19e5a3e8bb80befdecd750a5b303b74bbd3914eb762deefa0109",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.72,
          "end": 3.15,
          "en": "So, the OnPush strategy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.15,
          "end": 6.78,
          "en": "is a pretty powerful and important strategy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.78,
          "end": 10.08,
          "en": "that you might wanna consider implementing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.08,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "in your components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 16.35,
          "en": "However, I did not tell you everything about OnPush",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.35,
          "end": 19.65,
          "en": "because there is one additional trigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.65,
          "end": 24.39,
          "en": "that leads this component to be reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.39,
          "end": 25.77,
          "en": "when using OnPush,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.77,
          "end": 29.073,
          "en": "this component and its child components, potentially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.94,
          "end": 33.09,
          "en": "and that would be Signal changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.09,
          "end": 38.09,
          "en": "Now, Signals are a relatively new Angular feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.22,
          "end": 41.52,
          "en": "They have not been part of Angular since the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.52,
          "end": 45.93,
          "en": "Instead, they have been added to Angular with version 17",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.93,
          "end": 49.41,
          "en": "and therefore, you might not be using them in your projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.41,
          "end": 52.47,
          "en": "or you could use them but you don't like them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.47,
          "end": 55.77,
          "en": "And if you don't use them, everything about OnPush",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.77,
          "end": 59.13,
          "en": "is as I explained it in the previous lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 61.59,
          "en": "But if you are using Signals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.59,
          "end": 65.28,
          "en": "then Signal changes indeed also lead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 69.21000000000001,
          "en": "to OnPush becoming active, so to say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.21000000000001,
          "end": 72.72,
          "en": "or will lead to this component to be checked again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.72,
          "end": 75.42,
          "en": "this component and its child components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.42,
          "end": 76.89,
          "en": "That's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.89,
          "end": 79.98,
          "en": "And in many cases this might not matter too much",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.98,
          "end": 84.06,
          "en": "because Signals often change because of events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 88.26,
          "en": "which are being watched anyways because as I mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.26,
          "end": 91.02,
          "en": "events in this component or child components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.02,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "will trigger OnPush components to be checked again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 96.99000000000001,
          "en": "And therefore, then, it doesn't matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.99000000000001,
          "end": 99.96000000000001,
          "en": "if you're changing a Signal when that event occurs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.96000000000001,
          "end": 104.1,
          "en": "in such a event handler method or a regular property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.1,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "That does not matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 110.75999999999999,
          "en": "But one situation where it could matter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.75999999999999,
          "end": 113.91,
          "en": "is if you're using a service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.91,
          "end": 117.18,
          "en": "for sharing data across components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.18,
          "end": 118.86,
          "en": "because then you might be sharing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.86,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "across multiple OnPush components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 125.88,
          "en": "and you could end up in a situation where without Signals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.88,
          "end": 129.15,
          "en": "your code might not work as expected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.15,
          "end": 131.823,
          "en": "And that's what I'll show you next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
